               'input_o': '/home/ula/pyretis_run/project_masters/retis_grotthuss/gromacs_input/grompp.mdp',
               'topology': '/home/ula/pyretis_run/project_masters/retis_grotthuss/gromacs_input/topol.top'}

Particles settings
